From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui-egui: the shared lang setting picks the language when the app's own is auto

Gate review (brief task 5, owner 2026-10-24): the apps did not read lang from settings.toml. office_overlay::shared_lang_code reads it once (suite-core, native only; None for auto, no file, the web and tests); detect_system_lang uses it after WORDCRAFT_LANGUAGE and before the OS language. Adds the suite-core dependency (native) and its lock entries.
